{"full":"hf:Prajwal782007/Gridmind","spaceId":"Prajwal782007/Gridmind","name":"GridMind-RL","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","rl-environment","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":3,"created":"2026-04-05T19:06:10.000Z","updated":"2026-04-26T11:09:05.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://prajwal782007-gridmind.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Prajwal782007/Gridmind","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.924Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.924Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.924Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GridMind-RL — Train LLMs to manage industrial buildings under faults, grid stress, and natural language objectives.","Industrial buildings consume 40% of global electricity yet rely on naive \"always-on\" HVAC policies. LLMs can reason about pricing curves, fault alerts, and natural language objectives—but no environment trains them for this. GridMind-RL simulates a full 24-hour building energy system with stochastic electricity prices, equipment faults, and instruction cards, creating a genuinely challenging domain where learned policies translate to real operational value."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Prajwal782007/Gridmind/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f5ea9f6d36a312a66c429440a232b7587b6f554ddc17174b92da690c5cd1591a","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:49.007Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:49.007Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GridMind-RL — Train LLMs to manage industrial buildings under faults, grid stress, and natural language objectives.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Prajwal782007/Gridmind/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f5ea9f6d36a312a66c429440a232b7587b6f554ddc